        <mxCell id="flow_legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Video + Data Flow:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#e6550d&quot;&gt;❶&lt;/font&gt; IP Cameras → RTSP → MediaMTX (raw input streams)&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#e6550d&quot;&gt;❷&lt;/font&gt; MediaMTX → DeepStream: ROI Preprocess → RF-DETR → ByteTrack → ROI → FSM&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#e6550d&quot;&gt;❸&lt;/font&gt; tee Branch 1: nvvidconv → H.264 enc → RTP → UDP → MediaMTX (inference output)&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#e6550d&quot;&gt;❹&lt;/font&gt; tee Branch 2: fakesink probe → metadata/events/vlm.requests → Kafka&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#e6550d&quot;&gt;❺&lt;/font&gt; Kafka Workers: VLM, Alerts, TTS, Evidence, LPR, Logs&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#e6550d&quot;&gt;❻&lt;/font&gt; Frontend: WebRTC (WHEP) from MediaMTX + WS metadata overlay + REST API&#10;&#10;&lt;font color=&quot;#888&quot;&gt;Poly ROI → auto-computed bounding rect → crops input for nvinfer (saves GPU)&lt;br&gt;Users edit polygons only; rect derived automatically for preprocessing.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
